 loss", "Hypercalcemia with neurological/gastrointestinal manifestations"]}, "branches": {"B1": {"id": "B1", "label": "Endocrine/Metabolic Hypercalcemia", "level": 1, "status": "closed_for_now", "posterior": 0.024, "danger": 0.6, "parent": "ROOT", "closure_reason": "", "evidence_against": ["Lack of parathyroid imaging creates diagnostic uncertainty, weakly reducing confidence in primary hyperparathyroidism."]}, "B2": {"id": "B2", "label": "Malignancy with Paraneoplastic Syndrome", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "expanded", "prior": 0.0, "posterior": 0.626368184161166, "danger": 0.8, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.5, "evidence_for": ["Constitutional symptoms with hypercalcemia provide moderate support for malignancy as a paraneoplastic cause."], "evidence_against": ["Absence of tumor markers or imaging weakly reduces support for malignancy as the primary explanation."], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": ["B2.1", "B2.2", "B2.3"], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 2.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.9, "interrupt_relevance": 0.8, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "etiology", "representative_diseases": []}, "B3": {"id": "B3", "label": "Medication-Induced Hypercalcemia", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.18681318681318682, "posterior": 0.17037644951536107, "danger": 0.5, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": ["Antacid use alone with hypercalcemia weakly supports medication-induced hypercalcemia, but without calcium-containing agents, evidence is limited."], "evidence_against": ["Non-calcium antacids make medication-induced hypercalcemia less likely, but insufficient to exclude it."], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.6, "interrupt_relevance": 0.5, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "management_pathway", "representative_diseases": ["primary hyperparathyroidism", "humoral hypercalcemia of malignancy", "milk-alkali syndrome", "sarcoidosis"]}, "B4": {"id": "B4", "label": "Viral Illness with Constitutional Symptoms", "level": 1, "status": "parked", "posterior": 0.119, "danger": 0.3, "parent": "ROOT", "closure_reason": "", "evidence_against": []}, "B5": {"id": "B5", "label": "Other Hypercalcemic Disorders", "level": 1, "status": "parked", "posterior": 0.06, "danger": 0.4, "parent": "ROOT", "closure_reason": "", "evidence_against": []}, "B2.1": {"id": "B2.1", "label": "Squamous Cell Carcinoma (Lung/Head and Neck) with PTHrP Secretion", "parent": "B2", "level": 2, "status": "live", "prior": 0.36538144076068013, "posterior": 0.36538144076068013, "danger": 0.75, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.5, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.7, "interrupt_relevance": 0.8, "level_role": "disease_class", "classification_axis": "etiology", "representative_diseases": []}, "B2.2": {"id": "B2.2", "label": "Hematologic Malignancy (Lymphoma/Leukemia) with Hypercalcemia", "parent": "B2", "level": 2, "status": "live", "prior": 0.20878939472038865, "posterior": 0.20878939472038865, "danger": 0.7, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 2.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.65, "interrupt_relevance": 0.7, "level_role": "disease_class", "classification_axis": "management_pathway", "representative_diseases": ["humoral hypercalcemia of malignancy", "multiple myeloma", "squamous cell carcinoma", "primary hyperparathyroidism"]}, "B2.3": {"id": "B2.3", "label": "Metastatic Breast/Ovarian Cancer with Bone Involvement", "parent": "B2", "level": 2, "status": "live", "prior": 0.052197348680097164